    {
      "id": "d284e0dc-14d7-40e6-b6b2-fac332c8ac7f",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe como a palavra sugere franqueza sem dureza.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a4472563-00a7-4e26-86ed-f7d7dc2cf1f5",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Parece sincera.</strong></p><p>Use <strong>sincera</strong> quando a pessoa fala com clareza, não parece estar representando um papel e transmite confiança logo no começo.</p><p>Numa primeira impressão positiva, a palavra sugere franqueza sem soar agressiva.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1be882b7-ee73-477a-b2f0-15cb8df9307e",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a palavra e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5c314909-74f9-40ef-8d12-ba72eaa24639",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe alguém que entra bem na conversa.</p><p><strong>sociable</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>sociável</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/39899c3bb68f44d4a35c72354e68a5ee_b03-sociable-contexto.png?Expires=1794099564&Signature=Sv39I01USyTh2oU9yIKdAxmN1AVvUTVB1ShNdtFrxBMW2CrYf61wcxu-vqbEXfvOFUEWCtjtpyt4mPxm1AYUQeDBW0fITd65S0PIJkNwRz49nofnxGtDReWTHEm7fL4TtDTDDZZE9cOu-H3QSRvdMe8RHDqtZ25U0OfL4-xX4EvtW9n80JIu6k6mFk52sEmVl50QW-7iM4E6uspZfIUepAM80OJw1BNNSmc2Z4NsqRFYWSDxkrZo6zSySwkbsDhp7SkjwwW~DesJzDf1lCSj8lj7tXGlX-1kttWFzVxuzitEIv5ZWyKxCwlC6orTFiiI6PeoHlrGoMdKF3ZztImxzQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/241602b1aa6647e0b09cff3232725bc5_B1_M001_L01_audio_28402323_b03-sociable.mp3?Expires=1794099564&Signature=Mtl~hx9LZ51llWaCBASjG5SMcqLkLOh2KS9-h~eHGJ6SDOKoWibJZA1BhAZu-5-4xseVbW40ERaZDHcEt8uhus4QNZH5eealryDWXcTlIji~QoiZOghWnBQElQUNWjxzR1MkyfD75ScydJZGxAYCbpk19dORRq4hz8paRE7loChYB3rn12COlB~7GEPl3GAeqpdM1e2-mE2dEkimToUFzF4SMEks7jPf~XDcILiT~mkz5aaufwUDqa67NhR~cqYqJz4CA1Ao0dQJ~uFybrpwTEcggQ5UGkoQeyC-SNrkeu8eylXEf9xbJHLSx693CDT9kTCKrQjaf5Y72YaAoKdtlQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
