    {
      "id": "283123c3-ff27-4a1d-88cf-f19a3127536a",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe como a palavra combina com alguém que se conecta rápido com outras pessoas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "936cc2be-919e-4aad-8cee-8261babe1c5c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Parece sociable.</strong></p><p>Use <strong>sociable</strong> quando a pessoa puxa conversa, responde com facilidade e se conecta rápido com gente nova.</p><p>Essa palavra funciona bem em ambientes como aula, reunião ou encontro entre amigos.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "09feba5c-1fd5-4c73-ad64-e001d494ece4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a palavra e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "57ee8257-c729-42d9-ab3d-9419f1118841",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora foque no jeito calmo da cena.</p><p><strong>tranquila</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>tranquila</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b00c3adaeb584056991f267dd139e8a1_b05-tranquila-contexto.png?Expires=1794099564&Signature=CjyNDAn4rz36merpnFpb5t~RGPvEXyzqHuMV-6cp9EtziHpBGyrCHfBy1uhaesy1RoEgcaIlTFQYCQSKn2ejktchCF69MHmD3TG9Qm1KkE2qfAhxeRAbAdgyNKGVXhyD-9CA6-OCWVRIVHyRrWSc2zek-yil1rawrUuAbO6Cpm-t2EzQDdQ0R0RCrg~SJ9wRJ8r4RAfq8ApbUYWg0DEIkE5e~tKPcyRn9Btg99xxfsMynHljqFhCfv~2gwAI1WIj~KkBK4SWwLVqKTSI2r~sTrv3Z63xja0LyHS5EHlnPuk0Y1sa64fk69asUy0TiCAMzdCFpqEE32xKWmWvP4A9Qw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/da2d5deac2134302b3d671a0ae034e4c_b05-tranquila.mp3?Expires=1794099564&Signature=uHpmGqHto2K4Wtzp0-NNeX-lrc06QwePM3J~skFfU17Qwcilx9tNtvzZL1l3bd6d4Q1r~Jd2JYlNYvMUa1vricLhA5zaA2XAvMpVSyHXKk6ZoGaqn6qAkEPQdeB0UTSJ4L2aDDZ08utdFDFV4oD8bXgcVojcGr86NqAvqP2ARPYni2FJX1MBzlwTT4pFccFzx9FNk0XJr0ELCgM~c6Q0Fm58kLAvkrAAA2SFLmfE8vlOALp71bzMoLt4X-DmFD4Mmb55vHxOgeNaBHGwAzZGlHBUUm2ImmmNg-mRvYI0zhlkzib27upjojkZa1uvYxFkC35gLC5eX9lRtnhR4fu~wA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
